  "title": "How to reduce errors and friction in Pan-African Payroll",
  "summary": "With so many points of failure, and such a small margin for error, HR and Finance teams feel compelled to perform laborious manual checks. This brings more work and extra stress for people in their organizations.The process of fixing mistakes adds another layer of complexity, with different procedures in each country. Companies often find that fines and penalties costs more than preventing problems in the first place.",
